<p><strong>DoT Refund Obligation for Delayed Baggage from QF</strong><br />
<br />
Hi [insert contact name of interline carrier]</p>

<p><br />
We'd like to notify you about a mishandled baggage for the below passenger relating to their flight. Please process a refund accordingly as the merchant of record:<br />
<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;PNR<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Ticket number<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;World Tracer file number<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Bag Tag number/s of delayed bag/s<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Trip Departure Date<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Trip Arrival Date<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Flight number/s<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Departure Port<br />
•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Arrival Port<br />
<br />
Kind regards,<br />
Qantas Baggage Team<br />
<br />
<em>The contents of this document and any files transmitted with it may contain personal information and are confidential. They are intended solely for the use of the entity (or an authorised representative of the entity) to which they are addressed for the sole purpose of facilitating refunds for ancillary checked baggage fees for significantly delayed baggage, in accordance with the US Department of Transport’s final rule on Refunds and Other Consumer Protections .&nbsp;<br />
By continuing to access, use, or hold the documents, you agree to handle any personal information in accordance with relevant privacy laws, including the Australian Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018. We request that you protect the confidentiality of the documents with the same level of care as you would for your own confidential information. You acknowledge that you are prohibited from using the information other than for the sole purpose described above.<br />
If you are not the intended recipient of the documents, please notify the sender immediately by e-mail and delete the correspondence from your system. Further access, disclosure, distribution, use, modification or any other action taken in reliance on the contents of this information is strictly prohibited. Confidentiality is not waived or lost by reason of mistaken delivery to you.</em><br />
<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</p>
